prompt:
Add a --format option to the inventory CLI (python3 -m inventory FILE.csv): --format text (the default; output must stay exactly as it is now) or --format json. The JSON output must be one object printed to stdout with exactly this shape:

{"items": 5, "total_qty": 626, "total_value": "143.74", "locations": [{"name": "garage", "items": 2, "qty": 3, "value": "120.99"}, ...]}

Money values are strings in pounds with two decimals; locations are sorted by name. Put the JSON rendering in inventory/formatting.py next to the text rendering, wire the flag in inventory/cli.py, and document the flag in README.md.
